    {
        "content": "<p><code>omega</code>, <code>grind</code> and <code>linarith</code> only support linear integer arithmetic, and your goal is nonlinear. <code>nlinarith</code> solves your goal, and I believe that there are plans to add some support for nonlinear arithmetic to <code>grind</code> sometime in the future.</p>",
